NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000015 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000016 "=head1 NAME"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000017 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000018 "App::cpanm::script - Install modules from CPAN (via script name)"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000019 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000020 "=head1 VERSION"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000021 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000022 "This document describes version 0.002 of App::cpanm::script (from Perl distribution App-cpanm-script), released on 2017-06-17."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000023 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000024 "=head1 DESCRIPTION"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000025 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000026 "L<cpanm-script> is a simplistic wrapper over L<cpanm>. This command:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000027 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000028 " % cpanm-script -n csvutil"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000029 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000030 "will cause B<cpanm-script> to search for the release tarball that contains the"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000031 "script (currently via scraping C<https://metacpan.org/pod/SCRIPTNAME>) and will"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000032 "then run:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000033 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000034 " % cpanm -n PERLANCAR/App-CSVUtils-0.002.tar.gz"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000035 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000036 "That's about it."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000037 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000038 "=head1 HOMEPAGE"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000039 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000040 "Please visit the project's homepage at L<https://metacpan.org/release/App-cpanm-script>."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000041 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000042 "=head1 SOURCE"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000043 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000044 "Source repository is at L<https://github.com/perlancar/perl-App-cpanm-script>."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000045 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000046 "=head1 BUGS"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000047 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000048 "Please report any bugs or feature requests on the bugtracker website L<https://rt.cpan.org/Public/Dist/Display.html?Name=App-cpanm-script>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000049 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000050 "When submitting a bug or request, please include a test-file or a"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000051 "patch to an existing test-file that illustrates the bug or desired"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000052 "feature."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000053 ""
